# Legacy flat pages predate hash routing. A real 301 keeps link equity and
# stops thin redirect shells from being indexed as duplicates.
#
# Cloudflare Pages applies these rules regardless of whether a file exists at
# the source path, so they win over the shells still on disk. Pages also
# rewrites /page.html to its extension-less form, so both variants are listed.
# The meta refresh inside each shell stays as the fallback for hosts that
# ignore _redirects.

/contact.html          /#/contact          301
/event-details.html    /#/event-details    301
/sponsorship.html      /#/sponsorship      301
/upcoming-events.html  /#/upcoming-events  301

/contact               /#/contact          301
/event-details         /#/event-details    301
/sponsorship           /#/sponsorship      301
/upcoming-events       /#/upcoming-events  301
